	'k09d44f4e' => 'Therapists',
	'k0a729eaf' => 'The process begins when you or a loved one calls +1 555 0147 or writes to hello@tayori-nursing.example. Care-plan coordinator Elise Moreau reviews your inquiry, listens to your current situation, and calls you back within one working day. During this introductory phone conversation, we discuss your immediate clinical needs, clarify our 8 km service area, and schedule your initial assessment visit at a convenient date and time.',
	'k0b21cbbd' => 'in familiar surroundings.',
	'k0b5abf9c' => 'Book a home assessment',
	'k0baa346c' => 'Clear boundaries',
	'k0bfd5746' => 'What a visit<br>can be',
	'k0f75b138' => 'Your customized care plan contains clear, practical details regarding your home support. It outlines scheduled visit days and times, designated nursing procedures, wound management protocols, therapy exercises, and medication schedules. It also lists emergency escalation paths, contact details for Elise Moreau and our clinical team, and a plain itemization of visit fees so that financial expectations remain clear from day one.',
	'k0faed072' => 'We never charge travel fees or mileage surcharges for visits located within our designated 8 km service boundary around 14 Orchard Row. The visit rate agreed in your written plan covers travel entirely. The only potential supplement is the $15 per visit surcharge applied when you request care before 8:30 in the morning or after 18:00 in the evening.',
	'k122cebab' => 'In the plan',
	'k1233113f' => 'Jonah Abebe',
	'k1257e265' => 'To ensure punctual arrivals and responsive local care, we serve residential homes located within an 8 km radius of our 14 Orchard Row office. This catchment area allows our clinicians to reach any patient\'s doorstep in approximately 20 minutes by bicycle or car. If you are uncertain whether your address falls within our Linden Vale boundary, please contact our office coordinator.',
	'k12aab02e' => 'Mr. Delacroix: Mastering Daily Insulin',
	'k180c5d30' => 'Two common questions',
	'k19625d08' => 'in the familiar spaces of home.',
	'k1a40657a' => 'Office Location and Operating Hours',
	'k1a4a5f33' => 'We review progress together every 30 days and adjust visits as your needs change.',
	'k1d5792b5' => 'Pain management and comfort',
	'k1dd6297d' => 'Safe mobility and balance practice',
	'k1f4a3ca1' => 'Agree',
	'k1f76ef2a' => 'Through six weeks of regular rehabilitation visits, she practiced standing safely and walking out to the street until she was able to walk to the bakery again on her own.',
	'k2127536b' => 'We call back within 1 working day to discuss your situation.',
	'k2188f476' => 'in the rooms where',
	'k218dee48' => 'Tayori Nursing provides scheduled home healthcare, ongoing clinical monitoring, and scheduled rehabilitation. We do not provide acute emergency response, urgent surgical intervention, or ambulance transport. If you or a family member experience an acute, life-threatening medical emergency—such as sudden chest pain, severe shortness of breath, sudden weakness, or acute collapse—please call local emergency services immediately rather than our office or on-call line. Our team will coordinate with hospital staff after emergency treatment has begun.',
	'k221e705c' => 'Your name',
	'k24f65538' => 'What We Do Not Provide',
	'k25040106' => 'Mira Castell',
	'k25425c04' => 'people already live.',
	'k25e75058' => 'Start with a kitchen-table talk.',
	'k26ecbf17' => 'Assessment visit: $60',
	'k290d190f' => 'Our fees are transparent and fixed across all services. The initial 60-minute home assessment visit is $60. Subsequent nursing visits cost $48 for 30 minutes or $85 for 60 minutes. Rehabilitation visits with our physiotherapist or occupational therapist cost $70 for 40 minutes. Visits scheduled early or late (before 8:30 or after 18:00) carry an additional $15 per visit, while registered patients can maintain access to our 24-hour on-call line for $30 per month. Where your insurer has an agreement with us we send the bill to them; otherwise these are the self-pay prices. We give you a written estimate at the assessment visit.',
	'k2975e6f6' => 'Jonah Abebe leads our palliative and end-of-life care visits with deep clinical precision and gentle compassion. He coordinates closely with attending physicians, patients, and family members to ensure optimal symptom control, pain management, and dignity at home. Jonah\'s experienced bedside manner helps households navigate demanding medical circumstances with calm reassurance and unwavering professional support throughout every stage of care.',
	'k297c457c' => 'Our values',
