	'k54f540fe' => 'Service Area Boundary',
	'k567b8949' => 'Care Plan',
	'k56acf503' => 'Priya Raman leads our home-based physiotherapy visits, helping individuals rebuild physical strength, coordination, and mobility following surgery, falls, or illness. Her 40-minute rehabilitation sessions take place inside living rooms, stairwells, and outdoor pavements. Priya emphasizes practical, real-world movement, helping patients regain personal independence and navigate their home environments with renewed safety, ease, and confidence.',
	'k57edbf98' => 'Elise Moreau serves as the dedicated care-plan coordinator at our 14 Orchard Row office. She handles initial phone consultations, organizes visit timetables, and liaises directly with insurance providers. Elise ensures that written care agreements are completed within three days, shared with primary physicians, and reviewed every 30 days, keeping communication effortless between families and our visiting clinical team.',
	'k58303d2b' => 'A plain itemization of visit fees',
	'k58a2f229' => 'Following your initial telephone call or message, Elise Moreau contacts you within one working day. We generally arrange the kitchen-table assessment visit within two to three working days. In situations where an individual is being discharged from a hospital ward, we coordinate dates directly with the hospital discharge team to ensure visits begin the day you return home.',
	'k590e66dd' => '02 Cancellation',
	'k59ed7243' => '30-minute or 60-minute visits',
	'k5a50d85f' => 'Written plan agreed',
	'k5ba1f0cf' => 'Everyday experiences',
	'k5c117785' => 'or call +1 555 0147, Mon–Sat 8:30–18:00',
	'k5f4a1a8b' => 'Faced learning how to use an insulin pen at home following a new diagnosis. Our visiting nurse attended three visits a week to guide his technique, gradually tapering to one visit a week as he gained complete confidence.',
	'k6039c905' => 'In 2017, registered nurse Mira Castell founded Tayori Nursing to provide unhurried, personal clinical care in the rooms where people already live. The Japanese word tayori means someone to rely on, and our small practice was built on that quiet premise. After years in acute hospital settings, Mira recognized that recovery, long-term illness, and end-of-life care often proceed best in familiar surroundings. From our single office at 14 Orchard Row in Linden Vale, our team travels to households within an 8 km radius, ensuring every patient receives calm and steady attention.',
	'k60bb0e7a' => 'Book an assessment visit with a registered nurse in your own home, or call our Linden Vale office at +1 555 0147 (Mon–Sat 8:30–18:00). You can also write to <a href="mailto:hello@tayori-nursing.example">hello@tayori-nursing.example</a>.',
