	'k747c6a35' => 'Send message',
	'k74c39624' => 'Understanding care costs in advance is vital for peace of mind. During your kitchen-table assessment, we evaluate whether your existing insurance provider holds an agreement with Tayori Nursing. If covered, we submit all billing claims directly to your insurer on your behalf. For private or self-pay arrangements, we present an itemized written estimate specifying expected visit lengths, visit frequencies, and total monthly costs before care begins.',
	'k7686c62f' => 'Home visits',
	'k78110dbc' => 'Therapy exercises',
	'k786e3cc6' => 'Write to us',
	'k79ee4582' => 'We maintain clear, straightforward pricing with no hidden charges, giving you a written estimate at your home assessment visit.',
	'k7a1a5f3e' => 'Read',
	'k7b444df0' => 'Home Visits',
	'k7c409001' => 'Founder and director, registered nurse',
	'k7cdc3471' => 'Wound Dressing',
	'k7d3018f4' => 'Care-plan coordinator (office)',
	'k7d4dff22' => 'Nurse, evening and on-call coordinator',
	'k7dadd2a4' => 'Good to know',
	'k7f292a7e' => 'Tomás Ferreira',
	'k7ff237f4' => 'Visits we offer',
	'k7ff2aead' => 'While we offer comprehensive nursing, therapy, and palliative support, we maintain strict professional standards and direct medical emergencies straight to hospital emergency services without delay.',
	'k806c8c38' => 'Sofia Brandt specializes in post-surgical wound management, stoma care, and chronic skin integrity. Visiting homes throughout Linden Vale, she applies modern sterile techniques to dress complex wounds, monitor healing, and minimize tissue discomfort. Sofia is passionate about patient education, patiently guiding individuals and their family caregivers on daily skin hygiene, dressing maintenance, and infection prevention between scheduled visits.',
	'k8211fede' => 'During their father\'s final weeks with advanced illness, the Haddad family wished for him to remain resting in his own bedroom, surrounded by familiar photographs and the presence of his grandchildren. Lead nurse Jonah Abebe coordinated a comprehensive palliative visit schedule, managing medication administration, skin comfort, and symptom relief. Crucially, the family was enrolled in our 24-hour on-call line. When questions arose late in the evening regarding breathing changes or dose timing, Tomás Ferreira and Jonah provided immediate phone guidance and conducted evening visits whenever necessary. This steady clinical presence enabled the family to focus on companionship and quiet farewells, confident that professional medical assistance was always within reach just down the road in Linden Vale.',
	'k828ccc62' => 'Insurance, estimates<br>and cancellation',
	'k8307fac5' => 'How can we help?',
	'k83519d29' => 'Free to cancel or reschedule up to 24 hours before the visit.',
	'k8441fd30' => 'Gentle, unhurried nursing care focused on pain management, physical comfort, and emotional support in familiar surroundings. Coordinated closely with your physician.',
	'k84e715c1' => 'Healthcare needs evolve over time, which is why we conduct a formal care-plan review every 30 days. Your nurse or therapist assesses your clinical progress, evaluates recovery milestones, and listens to feedback from you and your family. If dressing frequency can be reduced or rehabilitation goals have advanced, we adjust the visit schedule and fees accordingly, keeping your medical team updated throughout.',
