	'k98596246' => 'That page is not here. Try the <a href="/">home page</a> or call +1 555 0147.',
	'k98a615db' => 'Nurse, Evening &amp; On-Call Coordinator',
	'k98ce4233' => 'Care begins where daily life happens. Based at 14 Orchard Row, our registered nurses and therapists visit homes across Linden Vale within an 8 km radius (about 20 minutes by bicycle or car), seven days a week from 8:00 to 20:00.',
	'k9ae87d78' => 'Who visits, where',
	'k9c0f6f86' => 'Your medical team kept updated',
	'k9c150266' => '03 Stay',
	'k9c1bbb66' => '01 Care',
	'k9d4e75ac' => 'Designated nursing procedures',
	'k9dd4b7ca' => 'Story 02',
	'k9e11e644' => 'Every visit schedule begins with careful listening and written agreement.',
	'k9e35b858' => 'Read Rosa’s story',
	'k9ecb3765' => 'First Call',
	'k9f08c767' => 'Nurse, Wound &amp; Stoma Care',
	'k9f2bfce4' => 'Palliative care offers gentle, holistic nursing support for individuals facing advanced illness, prioritizing comfort, pain relief, and emotional dignity. Led by lead nurse Jonah Abebe, our team visits regularly for 30-minute ($48) or 60-minute ($85) appointments to monitor symptoms, administer prescribed treatments, and support loved ones. Registered patients enrolled in palliative care also have access to our 24-hour on-call line for $30 per month, ensuring clinical advice and peace of mind through every evening and overnight hour.',
	'ka004cdba' => 'Please note',
	'ka0954971' => 'A steady commitment',
	'ka09ed578' => 'Home-based rehabilitation is designed to restore mobility, practical independence, and confidence in your own living environment. These 40-minute visits cost $70 and are conducted by our physiotherapist Priya Raman or occupational therapist Hana Okoye. Sessions focus on safe movement, gait practice, navigating domestic steps, and practicing daily living tasks such as getting out of bed or walking outdoors. Every rehabilitation exercise is tailored to your current physical baseline and personal goals, helping you safely regain function at your own pace.',
	'ka1ef772f' => 'dignity and quiet reassurance.',
	'ka292be17' => 'We believe home healthcare must adapt to your domestic rhythm rather than disrupting it. Our visits are scheduled with sufficient time for thorough clinical observation, unhurried conversations at the kitchen table, and practical assistance. We coordinate closely with your attending physician, sharing our visit notes and medication updates directly so that care remains coherent. Because we operate within a tight 8 km service area, our nurses spend less time in transit and more time listening, checking vitals, and supporting your family through every stage of treatment.',
	'ka43ce5d6' => 'Seven people,<br>one office',
	'ka6d5e94d' => 'You can contact our care-plan coordinator Elise Moreau by telephone at +1 555 0147 or via email at hello@tayori-nursing.example. When you leave a message or send an inquiry, we respond within one working day. We will discuss your circumstances, answer your initial questions about fees and schedules, and arrange a convenient 60-minute kitchen-table assessment visit in your home.',
	'ka7303000' => 'Book a home<br>assessment',
	'ka83806ec' => 'Within three days following your home assessment, we deliver a comprehensive written care plan alongside a transparent cost estimate. The document specifies visit durations, frequency, assigned clinicians, and defined health goals. Once you review and sign the agreement, we immediately share a copy with your attending doctor to ensure complete medical alignment before your regular home nursing or therapy visits begin.',
	'kaa09ddc4' => 'Rehab Walk on the Street Outside',
	'kaaa02811' => 'Visit days and times',
	'kab4a0ddd' => 'Lead Nurse, Palliative Care',
	'kab5d2cec' => 'Managing complex health needs at home can feel overwhelming after leaving the hospital. Whether you are recovering from surgery, learning to handle daily medications, or adapting to long-term illness, the transition requires steady clinical support. Family members often carry heavy caregiving responsibilities while navigating unfamiliar medical equipment and schedules.',
	'kac450cde' => 'Nursing Rooted in the Rhythm of the Neighborhood',
	'kacc5b503' => 'After receiving a diagnosis requiring daily insulin injections, Mr. Delacroix felt overwhelmed by pen dials, needle disposal, and blood glucose monitoring. Sofia Brandt began visiting his home three times a week. Sitting beside him at his dining table, Sofia guided his hands through priming the pen, checking cartridge levels, and rotating injection sites across his abdomen. They kept a clear logbook beside his morning tea mug. As Mr. Delacroix grew comfortable reading blood glucose numbers and calculating correct dosages, visits gradually tapered from three times weekly to two, and eventually to a single check-in. Having clinical guidance in his own kitchen allowed him to develop confidence and establish a calm, predictable daily routine without hospital visits.',
	'kacf9e3fb' => 'Wished for their father to spend his last weeks in peace in his own bedroom. With regular nursing visits and our 24-hour on-call line, the family had continuous guidance and clinical reassurance whenever questions arose.',
	'kad756a13' => 'The first stop of the morning brings a nurse to a quiet home for a 30-minute visit. The nurse unpacks blood pressure equipment, measures morning vitals, and sits alongside the patient to review the weekly pill organizer. Together, they review newly prescribed doses and confirm proper timing. The calm atmosphere allows the patient to ask questions about side effects before the day gets underway.',
	'kaec42d80' => 'it is a steady commitment',
	'kafe3db63' => '60 minutes at home',
	'kaff64a84' => 'Fees and insurance',
	'kb1e0070b' => 'From the briefing<br>to the family call',
	'kb26905a5' => 'Delivered within 3 days',
	'kb4862b8b' => 'Phone +1 555 0147 or hello@tayori-nursing.example',
	'kb48f76b8' => 'Tomás Ferreira manages our evening visits and coordinates the 24-hour on-call response line for registered patients. With extensive clinical experience, Tomás brings clear decision-making and a calm, reassuring voice to after-hours inquiries. He ensures that patients requiring evening medication administration, urgent advice, or sudden symptom checks receive prompt clinical support outside standard daytime office hours across Linden Vale.',
	'kb5894002' => 'Story 03',
	'kb5a83be2' => 'Rehabilitation at home',
	'kb63a32e9' => 'The Haddad family',
	'kb75e23ef' => 'We call back within 1 working day',
	'kb8881fd2' => 'First Visit: Blood Pressure and Medicines',
	'kba075e57' => 'A morning round',
	'kbbaff128' => 'Contact',
	'kbbe880e0' => 'How quickly can a nurse visit after my first phone call?',
	'kbd045575' => 'We understand that medical schedules, family obligations, and personal health can change unexpectedly. You may cancel or reschedule any planned visit free of charge provided you notify our office at least 24 hours before your scheduled appointment time. Cancellations made with less than 24 hours notice may incur the standard visit fee, as clinicians are reserved exclusively for your scheduled time slot.',
	'kbe033a19' => 'Our nursing visits focus on clinical assessment, chronic condition management, medication administration, and specialized wound and stoma care. Depending on your agreed care plan, appointments run for 30 minutes at $48 or 60 minutes at $85, with visits scheduled seven days a week between 8:00 and 20:00. Registered nurses such as Mira Castell, Sofia Brandt, or Tomás Ferreira visit your home to check vital signs, manage complex dressings, and review daily treatments, ensuring you stay steady and supported in your living room.',
	'kbe24a4ba' => 'Hana Okoye',
	'kbe87a368' => 'Where your insurer has an agreement with us we send the bill to them; otherwise these are the self-pay prices. We give you a written estimate at the assessment visit.',
	'kbed18544' => 'Injections and wound dressing',
	'kbee0a8cf' => 'Nothing here yet.',
	'kbee801c6' => 'Nurses',
	'kbf054144' => 'Read about the everyday experiences of patients and families who have received home nursing and rehabilitation support from our Linden Vale team.',
	'kbfcd136a' => 'Early or late visit (before 8:30 or after 18:00)',
	'kbfe9f0dd' => 'Contact details for Elise Moreau and the team',
	'kc09a141e' => 'Nursing visit, 30 min',
	'kc0b9b757' => 'Emotional support for the family',
	'kc0d57376' => 'Continuity, respect,<br>clear boundaries',
	'kc1562892' => 'If your insurance company has an active billing agreement with Tayori Nursing, our office submits all paperwork and invoices directly to them following each round of visits. You will only receive a statement for co-payments or uncovered deductibles outlined in your agreement. If your insurer does not hold a direct contract with us, we supply standard itemized receipts so you can submit claims for reimbursement.',
