	'kd5bc1529' => 'We reply within one working day. For an emergency, call your local emergency number.',
	'kd605eef1' => 'quietly alongside patients',
	'kd761d399' => 'Tayori Nursing is based at 14 Orchard Row in Linden Vale. Our administrative office is open Monday through Saturday from 8:30 to 18:00, and closed on Sundays and public holidays. Our visiting nurses and therapists provide scheduled home care seven days a week between 8:00 and 20:00. Registered patients have round-the-clock access to our 24-hour clinical on-call line for urgent evening and overnight assistance.',
	'kd7663fa4' => 'Talk',
	'kd7cd31ef' => 'Hana Okoye provides occupational therapy assessments and rehabilitation in the home, focusing on functional ergonomics and domestic independence. She evaluates how individuals interact with their furniture, doorways, and bathing facilities, recommending practical adjustments. Hana works patiently alongside patients to practice daily living activities—such as dressing, cooking, and safe transfers—enabling them to live safely, comfortably, and self-sufficiently at home.',
	'kd80ba76b' => 'Care-Plan Coordinator',
	'kd9199295' => 'Next, an experienced nurse conducts a 60-minute assessment visit in your home for $60. We sit down together at your kitchen table to evaluate your medical history, current prescriptions, daily physical mobility, and domestic environment. Family members or caregivers are warmly invited to participate. This unhurried conversation allows us to understand your personal routines and specific healthcare preferences before drafting your care recommendations.',
	'kdc72be8e' => 'Our visiting nurses step in to bridge that gap with clear, practical routines. We monitor vital signs, attend to surgical wounds, and assist with daily treatments right in your own living space, giving you and your family the reassurance and stability needed to focus on everyday recovery.',
	'kdcc5675e' => 'Mira Castell established Tayori Nursing in 2017 to bring attentive, high-quality clinical healthcare directly into Linden Vale homes. As founder and director, she oversees clinical quality while continuing to conduct primary assessments and routine home nursing visits. Mira believes unhurried observation and warm personal communication form the true foundation of exceptional home-based recovery and ongoing medical support.',
	'kdd10db4b' => 'How do I know if my street is within your 8 km boundary?',
	'kdde905dc' => 'Insurance and Written Estimates',
	'kdeecd0c6' => 'We arrive punctually, treat your personal space with care, and include your family members whenever you wish.',
	'kdf814135' => 'Office',
	'kdff17430' => 'to the daily life of Linden Vale.',
	'ke0501f50' => 'Founded in 2017 by Mira Castell, Tayori Nursing brings experienced, unhurried healthcare directly into homes across Linden Vale.',
	'ke072db9c' => 'Our 8 km operating perimeter extends across central Linden Vale and its immediate surrounding residential neighborhoods. If your residence can be reached from 14 Orchard Row in roughly 20 minutes by road or bicycle, you are within our service territory. Feel free to telephone +1 555 0147 with your street address, and we will confirm our service availability immediately.',
	'ke0749d50' => 'The day begins at 14 Orchard Row with our morning clinical briefing. Mira Castell, lead nurse Jonah Abebe, evening coordinator Tomás Ferreira, and care-plan coordinator Elise Moreau gather around the table with warm mugs and laptops. The team reviews overnight updates from the on-call line, verifies daily schedules, checks medication supplies, and confirms route logistics across Linden Vale before packing medical bags and setting out on foot, bicycle, or car.',
	'ke0b7f9e6' => 'Physiotherapy and occupational therapy',
	'ke16336e3' => 'Priya Raman',
	'ke182b5e8' => 'You see the same familiar clinicians, allowing genuine trust and understanding to develop over successive visits.',
	'ke2a3a184' => 'Care where life already is',
